<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Password Changed</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
  <div style="max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px 40px;">

    <img src="{{emailBannerUrl}}" alt="FormaChat" width="480" style="width:100%; max-width:480px; display:block; margin:32px auto 28px; border:0;">

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 16px;">Hello,</p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 8px;">
      Your FormaChat account password was successfully changed on <strong>{{changedAt}}</strong>.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:24px 0 8px;"><strong>Didn't make this change?</strong></p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 24px;">
      Your account may be compromised. <a href="mailto:support@formachat.com?subject=URGENT:%20Unauthorized%20Password%20Change&body=My%20account%20password%20was%20changed%20without%20my%20permission.%20Please%20lock%20my%20account%20immediately." style="color:#636b2f; font-weight:600;">Contact us immediately</a> to lock your account.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0 0 8px;">
      If this was you, you're all set. A couple of reminders to keep your account secure:
    </p>
    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.9; color:#333333; margin:0 0 24px;">
      - Use a strong, unique password from a password manager.<br>
      - Never reuse the same password across sites.<br>
      - Consider enabling two-factor authentication in your account settings.
    </p>

    <p style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.65; color:#333333; margin:0;">Stay secure,<br>The FormaChat Team</p>

    <hr style="border:none; border-top:1px solid #636b2f; opacity:0.25; margin:32px 0 20px;">

    <p style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.6; color:#999999; margin:0;">
      &copy; {{currentYear}} FormaChat. All rights reserved.<br>
      Security alert - do not reply to this email.
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>
